{
    "title": "Bible Trivia - Word Quiz Game",
    "description": "\ud83e\udde0Are you ready to test your knowledge and deepen your understanding of the Christian faith? Bible Trivia combines knowledge with fun, providing a new way to learn Christianity. Through daily trivia quizzes, you can train your brain and expand your understanding of the Old and New Testaments, while learning more about the rich stories in the Bible.\r\n\r\n\r\nWarning: Highly addictive! Once you start progressing through the levels, you won\u2019t be able to stop! In Bible Trivia, you learn by levels, and in a short time, you will become a knowledgeable scholar! Play the free trivia quiz game and increase your knowledge now. Engaging Bible questions and answers will guide you through the important facts of Christianity. You'll love this word game if you're a fan of Bible games or trivia puzzle! With new daily trivia puzzle challenges, you'll deepen your understanding and strengthen your Christian faith. Plus, Bible Trivia supports offline, so you can test your knowledge anytime, anywhere. Now, join the leaderboard online or just enjoy this puzzle word game offline.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1How to Play Bible Trivia - Word Quiz Game:\ud83d\udca1\r\n\u271d Tap the right answer button in the multiple choices for each trivia question;\r\n\u271d You need to catch the right answer in 25 seconds to complete the trivia question; \r\n\u271d There are 3 trivia questions for each puzzle, and a mysterious reward awaits after you finish!\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2728\ufe0fFeatures of Bible Trivia - Word Quiz Game:\u2728\ufe0f\r\n\u271d Supports offline, you can enjoy trivia puzzle challenges without the internet;\r\n\u271d Over 5,000 Bible questions and answers, all offline;\r\n\u271d Easy to play, enjoy trivia puzzle challenges anytime, anywhere;\r\n\u271d Combines challenge and fun, train your brain;\r\n\u271d Daily free rewards and gifts to keep you motivated;\r\n\u271d Bible quizzes suitable for both adults and children;\r\n\u271d A comprehensive handbook to test your knowledge;\r\n\u271d Rich trivia covering stories, saints, and verses for deeper exploration;\r\n\u271d The best Bible trivia puzzle, combining knowledge and entertainment.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6\ufe0fWhy Choose Bible Trivia - Word Quiz Game?\ud83c\udfc6\ufe0f\r\n1. Train Your Brain:\r\nWhether you\u2019re just starting to learn the Bible or have been studying for years, this word game will help you further test your knowledge and train your brain. The Bible questions and answers cover the Old Testament, and New Testament, helping you gain a deeper understanding of the Christian faith. All these puzzle support offline.\r\n\r\n2. Diverse Challenges:\r\nEvery day brings fresh trivia puzzle challenges, covering a wide range of topics. Each puzzle is a growth opportunity, allowing you to gradually enhance your knowledge and become a Bible scholar.\r\n\r\n3. 100% Free:\r\nA completely free word game experience with no need for internal purchase. All levels, Bible questions and answers, are available at no cost. Whether it's daily quiz challenges, question hints, or mysterious rewards, all features are free, ensuring you can enjoy learning and testing your knowledge without paying.\r\n\r\n4. Global Leaderboard:\r\nJoin the global trivia quiz competition and see who stands out in Bible Trivia! Accumulate points by answering questions and climbing the global leaderboard. Continuously challenge yourself, improve your ranking, and become one of the world\u2019s top Bible knowledge masters!\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaeDownload Bible Trivia - Word Quiz Game now and train your brain! By fun Bible questions and answers, you\u2019ll not only test your knowledge of the Bible but also compete with players worldwide on the global leaderboard. Whether you\u2019re a beginner or an experienced Bible scholar, this word game offers the perfect blend of entertainment and knowledge. It\u2019s completely free and supports offline, so you can enjoy trivia puzzle anywhere, anytime. We will continue to add more Bible questions and answers so you can keep learning Christianity. Join us now, and as you embark on the journey to becoming a Bible quiz master, you will gain rich rewards and a sense of accomplishment!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83e\udde0Are you ready to test your knowledge and deepen your understanding of the Christian faith? Bible Trivia combines knowledge with fun, providing a new way to learn Christianity. Through daily trivia quizzes, you can train your brain and expand your understanding of the Old and New Testaments, while learning more about the rich stories in the Bible.<br><br><br>Warning: Highly addictive! Once you start progressing through the levels, you won\u2019t be able to stop! In Bible Trivia, you learn by levels, and in a short time, you will become a knowledgeable scholar! Play the free trivia quiz game and increase your knowledge now. Engaging Bible questions and answers will guide you through the important facts of Christianity. You&#39;ll love this word game if you&#39;re a fan of Bible games or trivia puzzle! With new daily trivia puzzle challenges, you&#39;ll deepen your understanding and strengthen your Christian faith. Plus, Bible Trivia supports offline, so you can test your knowledge anytime, anywhere. Now, join the leaderboard online or just enjoy this puzzle word game offline.<br><br><br>\ud83d\udca1How to Play Bible Trivia - Word Quiz Game:\ud83d\udca1<br>\u271d Tap the right answer button in the multiple choices for each trivia question;<br>\u271d You need to catch the right answer in 25 seconds to complete the trivia question; <br>\u271d There are 3 trivia questions for each puzzle, and a mysterious reward awaits after you finish!<br><br><br>\u2728\ufe0fFeatures of Bible Trivia - Word Quiz Game:\u2728\ufe0f<br>\u271d Supports offline, you can enjoy trivia puzzle challenges without the internet;<br>\u271d Over 5,000 Bible questions and answers, all offline;<br>\u271d Easy to play, enjoy trivia puzzle challenges anytime, anywhere;<br>\u271d Combines challenge and fun, train your brain;<br>\u271d Daily free rewards and gifts to keep you motivated;<br>\u271d Bible quizzes suitable for both adults and children;<br>\u271d A comprehensiv